      "en": "A prudent man sees danger and hides himself; but the simple pass on, and suffer for it.",
      "ko": "슬기로운 자는 재앙을 보면 숨어 피하여도 어리석은 자들은 나아가다가 해를 받느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "811a4c54e60952eca10b6e39cad362c5147e4b159928ad835da1658bf50b9c9f",
      "translation_text_hash": "6be02e31d008bb630495ac10fa7f5f29b363c287d620692893a98630b6cac115",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
